{
    "name": "browser-sign-in",
    "title": "Browser sign-in",
    "description": "Browser sign-in: when Pi's browser is at a sign-in, the person types the username and password, or a one-time code, on a card in the chat, and the values go straight into the page. Pi never sees them, and neither does the transcript. For a CAPTCHA or a sign-in to approve on a phone, Pi asks the person to do it in the Browser panel and tap Done.",
